@startuml
title Workstation Activity & Geofenced Field Operations Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ActivityFontColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #1d4ed8
skinparam SwimlaneWidth 220
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontColor #1e3a8a
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 14
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold

skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

|Employee|
start
:Launch Desktop Agent & Mobile GPS Clock-in;

|System Administrator|
:Capture Activity Telemetry & Periodic Screenshots;
:Calculate Active vs Idle Work Ratios;
if (Idle Exceeds Limit?) then (Exceeded)
  :Pause Active Work Timer & Flag Event;
else (Normal)
  :Log Standard Active Hours;
endif

|Department Manager|
:Dispatch Field Service Ticket to Mobile Staff;

|Employee|
:Travel to Client Location & Geofenced Check-in;
:Complete Field Task & Collect Client E-Signature;
:Submit Field Completion Status & Site Photos;

|Department Manager|
:Audit Field Work Order & Approve Service Ticket;
stop
@enduml
